> library(qs)    # read existing sim_results_100.qs (legacy format)
qs 0.27.3. Announcement: https://github.com/qsbase/qs/issues/103
> library(qs2)   # write edges_all_*.qs2 for HepCep4Py
qs2 0.2.1

Attaching package: ‘qs2’

